---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Sec from '../components/Sec.astro';
import Archive from '../components/Archive.astro';
import ObjectStudy from '../components/ObjectStudy.astro';
---
<Base title="Tanaka Sande" description="Tanaka Sande is a product designer working across objects, brands and graphics. Harare, Zimbabwe. Open to remote work.">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="who">
    <h1 class="name" id="who"><span>Tanaka</span><span>Sande</span></h1>
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="state">Product designer. Objects, brands and the graphics <em>that hold them together.</em></p>
        <dl class="spec">
          <dt>Practice</dt><dd>Product · Brand · Graphic</dd>
          <dt>Trained</dt><dd>Ningbo University, China</dd>
          <dt>Based</dt><dd>Harare, Zimbabwe · UTC+2</dd>
          <dt>Status</dt><dd><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Open to remote work</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <ObjectStudy />
    </div>
  </section>

  <Sec n="01" title="Index" id="index">
    <Archive />
  </Sec>

  <Sec n="02" title="About" id="about">
    <p>I've been redesigning the objects around me for as long as I can remember. I trained in product design in China and work from Harare, across furniture, consumer products, restaurant brands, packaging and apparel.</p>
    <p>For the past two years I've led the brands of a group of businesses in Harare: a restaurant, an apparel label, a printing company. I also run <a href="https://anti-formula.com" rel="noopener">Anti-Formula</a>, my studio for objects and the brands I'm building.</p>
    <div class="notes">
      <div><span class="ro"><b>N.01</b></span><p>A design has to make me feel something before it earns the right to be measured.</p></div>
      <div><span class="ro"><b>N.02</b></span><p>Trends hand everyone the same blueprint. I'd rather follow the object.</p></div>
      <div><span class="ro"><b>N.03</b></span><p>A small mistake becomes an expensive one once it's made a thousand times.</p></div>
    </div>
  </Sec>

  <Sec n="03" title="Contact" id="contact">
    <dl class="contact">
      <dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:sandetanaka@gmail.com">sandetanaka@gmail.com</a></dd>
      <dt>Phone</dt><dd>+263 71 326 4354</dd>
      <dt>Studio</dt><dd><a href="https://anti-formula.com" rel="noopener">anti-formula.com</a></dd>
    </dl>
  </Sec>
</Base>
